error[E0601]: the spawned call is not task-safe: it reaches 'zero', which uses the reassignable binding 'base'
  --> $DIR/spawn-initializer.nra:18:21
   |
12 |     export static let zero = func() -> Money => new Money(base);
   |                                                           ---- uses the reassignable binding 'base' here
...
15 | let make = func<T: Additive<T>>() -> T => T.zero();
   |                                           -------- calls 'zero'
...
18 |         last task = spawn make<Money>();
   |                     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this call must be task-safe
   |                           ------------- calls 'make<Money>'
   |
   = note: `neura check --task-safety` reports for every function whether it is task-safe, and why not

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0601`.
